              "id": "73865daeb736",
              "kind": "list_item",
              "provenance": {
                "extractor": "segment",
                "stage": "build_tree"
              },
              "text": "* Specialty Producers and Other Producers are adjusted to reflect the correct catalogue code at branch level. Reference works are aggregated to other producers."
            },
            {
              "attrs": {},
              "bbox": {
                "page": 0,
                "x0": 68,
                "x1": 539,
                "y0": 270,
                "y1": 303
              },
              "children": [],
              "id": "e4103ef4e58e",
              "kind": "list_item",
              "provenance": {
                "extractor": "segment",
                "stage": "build_tree"
              },
              "text": "\u2022 Given the continued strong digital lending performance and regional opportunity, the Audio & Digital cap is to be revised to 20% from 15% to support eBook program expansion and to offset the reduction in the overall Collection portfolio on the back of lower Books sub-category exposures."
            },
            {
              "attrs": {},
              "bbox": {
                "page": 0,
                "x0": 68,
                "x1": 545,
                "y0": 313,
                "y1": 345
              },
              "children": [],
              "id": "d8c446eb4a79",
              "kind": "list_item",
              "provenance": {
                "extractor": "segment",
                "stage": "build_tree"
              },
              "text": "\u2022 In recognising the change in the collection composition, combined with the books category still grappling with print decline, weakened demand and elevated storage costs, the Books cap is being revised downward to a maximum of 40% (previously 55%) or 50,000 items (previously 65,000)."
            }
          ],
          "id": "ea59176e798d",
          "kind": "list",
          "provenance": {},
          "text": null
        },
        {
          "attrs": {},
          "bbox": {
            "page": 0,
            "x0": 67,
            "x1": 545,
            "y0": 362,
            "y1": 393
          },
          "children": [],
          "id": "61667a454f93",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "provenance": {
            "extractor": "segment",
            "stage": "build_tree"
          },
          "text": "The Other Producers and Other Media cap is at 15% primarily to support transition projects in Specialty Collections production not covered under other sub-segment caps and as detailed under the \u201cPreservation / Sustainability / Heritage Limits\u201d section8."
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "bbox": {
            "page": 0,
            "x0": 68,
            "x1": 306,
            "y0": 414,
            "y1": 423
          },
          "children": [],
          "id": "46d8844bdb4c",
          "kind": "heading",
          "provenance": {
            "extractor": "segment",
            "stage": "build_tree"
          },
          "text": "Branches (Breakdown by Service Area (\u201cSVC\u201d) Region):"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {},
          "bbox": {
            "page": 0,
            "x0": 108,
            "x1": 359,
            "y0": 436,
            "y1": 445
          },
          "children": [],
          "id": "5e707bf35087",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "provenance": {
            "extractor": "segment",
            "stage": "build_tree"
          },
          "text": "North, Central, South are the top 3 areas in terms of circulation."
        },
        {
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "bbox": {
            "page": 0,
            "x0": 67,
            "x1": 73,
            "y0": 440,
            "y1": 446
          },
          "children": [],
          "id": "bc746b7daf96",
          "kind": "heading",
          "provenance": {
            "extractor": "segment",
            "stage": "build_tree"
          },
          "text": "o"
        },
        {
          "attrs": {},
          "bbox": {
            "page": 0,
            "x0": 108,
            "x1": 526,
            "y0": 454,
            "y1": 463
          },
          "children": [],
          "id": "01d9dab0fe1c",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "provenance": {
            "extractor": "segment",
            "stage": "build_tree"
          },
          "text": "No specific area cap is proposed but the collection should continue to be managed in a balanced manner."
        },
        {
